Package: Ingest
Type: Project
Title: PopHIVE Data Ingestion Pipeline
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Standardizes public health surveillance data for the PopHIVE
    platform (pophive.org). This is not an installable R package; this file
    exists so that pak's dependency resolution (used by
    r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies) reads declared dependencies here
    instead of falling back to auto-scanning R/Rmd source files, which can
    trip an upstream parsing bug in pkgdepends::scan_deps() on certain
    knitr chunk-option calls.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
